sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant PP as PaipanPage
    participant DB as DoodleBoard
    participant PV as PanView
    participant PA as paipan(engine)
    participant PM as panMarkers(engine)
    participant SV as doodleSvg(engine)
    participant DBX as guashiRepo(IndexedDB)
    participant EM as exportMd
    participant IM as importMd

    Note over U,IM: 起卦 → 画板 → 保存 → 导出
    U->>PP: 起卦(参数)
    PP->>PA: paipan({method,params,date,markers:readMarkers()})
    PA->>PM: computePanMarkers({yao,bian,monthGZ,dayGZ,gongWx,markers})
    PM-->>PA: pan.markers
    PA-->>PP: pan(含 guashen/xianggui/chuangzhang/markers)
    PP->>PV: <PanView pan doodle doodleEnabled/>
    U->>PP: 勾选画板开关
    PP->>PV: onDoodleToggle(true)
    PV->>DB: <DoodleBoard enabled/>
    U->>DB: 画笔/形状/文字/撤销
    DB->>DB: 记录矢量元素
    DB-->>PP: onChange(doodle) 独立 state
    U->>PP: 保存卦例
    PP->>DBX: addGuashi({...,panSnapshot:pan,doodle,...duan(含background)})
    DBX-->>PP: saved
    U->>PP: 导出 md
    PP->>EM: guashiToMd(saved)
    EM->>SV: doodleToDataUri(doodle)
    EM-->>PP: md(盘面+标记列+香闺床帐 → 涂鸦节 → 背景节 → 断语…)

    Note over U,IM: 导入 md → 重排盘 → 画板还原
    U->>PP: 导入 md
    PP->>IM: mdToGuashi(mdText)
    IM->>IM: parseBody: 涂鸦JSON块/背景/笔记(别名beizhu)
    IM-->>PP: guashi{method,params,doodle,background,beizhu}
    PP->>PA: paipan(按 method/params 重排, 读当前 markers)
    PA-->>PP: 新 pan(标记自动恢复)
    PP->>PV: PanView 展示 + 涂鸦还原
    PP->>DB: DoodleBoard 回填 doodle
